/T (Restaurant customers often make decisions using only distance or opening status. A restaurant that is close may still require a long wait, while a farther restaurant may have seats available immediately. There is therefore a need for a simple system that combines restaurant occupancy, waiting queue information, and estimated waiting time into one usable view.)
/E (Restaurant customers often make decisions using only distance or opening status. A restaurant that is close may still require a long wait, while a farther restaurant may have seats available immediately. There is therefore a need for a simple system that combines restaurant occupancy, waiting queue information, and estimated waiting time into one usable view.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
