/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 60 0 R
/T (The Smart Restaurant Occupancy System demonstrates how a practical restaurant problem can be converted into a modular Python application. The current version focuses on reliable occupancy and queue management, waiting-time estimation, simple customer decision support, and local storage. Its architecture also leaves room for future automation through sensors or computer vision.)
/E (The Smart Restaurant Occupancy System demonstrates how a practical restaurant problem can be converted into a modular Python application. The current version focuses on reliable occupancy and queue management, waiting-time estimation, simple customer decision support, and local storage. Its architecture also leaves room for future automation through sensors or computer vision.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
