/Title (The Smart Restaurant Occupancy System demonstrates how a practical restaurant problem can be converted into a modular Python application. The current version focuses on reliable occupancy and queue management, waiting-time estimation, simple customer decision support, and local storage. Its architecture also leaves room for future automation through sensors or computer vision.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 334 0 R
/Next 491 0 R
>>
